      "comment": "INDULGEME (6) broke on debut but showed ability when second last start at Melton last start, leading from a similar barrier and sticking on to be beaten 2.3 metres. With further progression likely he can go one better. POSTER COMMAND (10) made a strong debut last start when he led for an impressive win by 10 metres at Bathurst. Draws on the back row this time but has plenty of upside. LACE AND LEATHER (9) is another that may need luck from the back row but he has shown promise in recording a win and a second in two starts at Melton so far. ONELOOK (11) chased a good filly when midfield in a Vicbred heat last start. Either won or placed at her four other starts so is worth another chance.",
